---
classDiagram
direction LR

namespace `Task 6 — Java API и trace-контекст` {
  class BatchJobClient {
    -String DEFAULT_ENDPOINT$
    +main(args String[]) void$
  }

  class JobLaunchController {
    -JobLauncher jobLauncher
    -Job importProductJob
    -Tracer tracer
    +launch() ResponseEntity~JobLaunchResponse~
    -currentTraceId() String
  }

  class JobLaunchResponse {
    <<record>>
    -Long jobExecutionId
    -String jobName
    -String status
    -String traceId
  }

  class HttpTraceLoggingFilter {
    +doFilterInternal(request, response, filterChain) void
    +shouldNotFilter(request) boolean
  }

  class BatchObservabilityListener {
    +beforeJob(jobExecution) void
    +afterStep(stepExecution) ExitStatus
    +afterJob(jobExecution) void
  }

  class JobLauncher {
    <<Spring Batch>>
    +run(job, parameters) JobExecution
  }

  class Tracer {
    <<Micrometer Tracing>>
    +currentSpan() Span
  }

  class OncePerRequestFilter {
    <<Spring Web>>
  }
}

BatchJobClient ..> JobLaunchController : POST + traceparent
JobLaunchController --> JobLauncher : запускает Job
JobLaunchController --> Tracer : читает traceId
JobLaunchController *-- JobLaunchResponse : возвращает
HttpTraceLoggingFilter --|> OncePerRequestFilter
HttpTraceLoggingFilter ..> JobLaunchController : логирует API-вызов
JobLauncher ..> BatchObservabilityListener : Job / Step events
